 "full": "<div class=\"stack-3\" data-v-042d9ce4><div class=\"formal profile event-brand\" data-v-042d9ce4><div class=\"profile-strap\" style=\"background:#2a6f4e;\" data-v-042d9ce4><span class=\"profile-strap-word\" data-v-042d9ce4>lanyard</span><span class=\"profile-strap-card\" data-v-042d9ce4>Event check-in</span></div><div class=\"profile-body\" data-v-042d9ce4><div class=\"page-head\" data-v-042d9ce4><h1 data-v-042d9ce4>Spring night</h1><p class=\"sub\" data-v-042d9ce4><span data-v-042d9ce4>Room 4 · </span>Fri 20 November at 18:00</p></div></div></div><dl class=\"panel event-info\" data-v-042d9ce4><dt class=\"label\" data-v-042d9ce4>Access</dt><dd data-v-042d9ce4>Step-free</dd><dt class=\"label\" data-v-042d9ce4>Food and drink</dt><dd data-v-042d9ce4>Pizza</dd></dl><div class=\"notice\" data-v-042d9ce4> Checking in unlocks perks and the event album. If you choose to, you can also appear in the attendee room. Hosts see aggregate numbers only — never who connected with whom. </div><label class=\"checkbox-row\" style=\"margin:4px 0;\" data-v-042d9ce4><input type=\"checkbox\" data-v-042d9ce4><span class=\"small\" data-v-042d9ce4> Show me in this event&#39;s attendee room to other checked-in people. </span></label><div class=\"field\" data-v-042d9ce4><label for=\"name\" data-v-042d9ce4>Your name</label><input id=\"name\" value=\"\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"name\" data-v-042d9ce4></div><div class=\"field\" data-v-042d9ce4><label for=\"extra1\" data-v-042d9ce4>Course</label><input id=\"extra1\" value=\"\" type=\"text\" data-v-042d9ce4></div><div class=\"panel stack-2\" data-v-042d9ce4><span class=\"label\" data-v-042d9ce4>Sponsors</span><label class=\"checkbox-row\" data-v-042d9ce4><input type=\"checkbox\" data-v-042d9ce4><span class=\"small\" data-v-042d9ce4> Share my name, course and tags with <strong data-v-042d9ce4>Acme</strong><span data-v-042d9ce4> — Free pens</span></span></label><p class=\"small muted\" data-v-042d9ce4>Each sponsor is a separate, optional